# Ownership matrix from docs/PLAN.md §7. Every path has exactly one writer.
#
# This file encodes rule 1 of the parallel-work arrangement: a workstream
# writes only its own directories and reads everyone else's. A pull request
# touching someone else's paths is flagged here rather than discovered in a
# rebase.
#
# SETUP: the team handles below do not exist yet. Create them under the
# Abyssinia-Labs org, or replace each with an individual @handle, before this
# file has any effect. GitHub silently ignores rules naming a team it cannot
# resolve, so an unconfigured CODEOWNERS is worse than none — it looks like
# protection while providing none.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Wave 0 — frozen contracts. Changes here are amendments: small, reasoned,
# and rebased onto by everyone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/go.mod                             @Abyssinia-Labs/ws-00-contracts
/go.sum                             @Abyssinia-Labs/ws-00-contracts
/Makefile                           @Abyssinia-Labs/ws-00-contracts
/LICENSE                            @Abyssinia-Labs/ws-00-contracts
/CODEOWNERS                         @Abyssinia-Labs/ws-00-contracts
